# Large regenerable artifacts.  What IS tracked is the minor-minimal list
# itself (data/minimal_*.txt), the new small certificate files, the state
# files that pin the data prefix, and the machine-readable reports.
#
# Regeneration, in order (see MINOR_THEORY.md section 11):
#   python harvest.py --tag sweep --realizable-sample 2000   [--extend]
#   python harvest_pilot.py
#   python minorsweep.py --in data/harvest_sweep.jsonl  --tag sweep   --workers 2
#   python minorsweep.py --in data/harvest_uniform.jsonl --tag uniform --workers 2
#   python analyze.py --tag sweep ; python analyze.py --tag uniform
#   python cert47.py ; python rank3check.py ; python fastminor.py
#   python liftcert.py --sample 40 --canary ; python canaries.py --tag sweep --all
# and, for the tracked minimal-set certificates:
#   (see MINOR_THEORY.md section 11 -- one filter over data/harvest_sweep.jsonl)

data/harvest_*.jsonl
data/minors_*.jsonl
data/certs_minimal_*.jsonl
data/idcache_*.npz
data/cat48_keys.npz
data/cat48_lines.txt
data/minors_trial.*
